- Upload official templates.
- Name templates.
- Version templates.
- Assign templates to colleges.
- Activate or deactivate templates.
- View template versions.

Templates must be college-specific.

The official Lapu-Lapu City College RSS template will be provided separately. Do not invent its actual layout.

Until the official template is supplied, implement the report-generation architecture without claiming that the generated PDF matches the official document.

### PDF requirements

- Match the official template when provided.
- Use the exact approved accomplishment information.
- Include the correct student/section information.
- Generate individual reports.
- Generate consolidated section reports.
- Save generated PDFs to protected storage.
- Store the report metadata.
- Preserve historical report versions.
- Make authorized downloads possible.

