# 13. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

Use a maintainable layered architecture.

Expected architecture:

Users
  |
  v
Browser / Responsive Web Interface
  |
  v
Frontend
  |
  v
Laravel Application
  |
  +-- Authentication
  +-- Authorization
  +-- Controllers
