- Academic years: create, view, update, archive.
- Task categories: create, view, update, deactivate.
- Tasks: create, view, edit, publish, cancel, archive.
- Sessions: create, view, update.
- Applications: submit, view, withdraw when permitted.
- Application reviews: create and view review history.
- Accomplishments: draft, view, update draft.
- Submissions: create versions and view history.
- Reviews: create and view history.
- Evidence: upload and view authorized evidence.
- Attendance: record, view, correct under controlled rules.
- Adjustments: request, review, approve or reject.
- Templates: upload, view, activate, deactivate.
- Reports: generate, view, download, archive.
- Notifications: create, view, mark read.
- Audit logs: system generated and authorized viewing.

Never provide unrestricted deletion for official records.

