- Valid login.
- Invalid login.
- Pending account.
- Rejected registration.
- Suspended account.
- Deactivated account.
- Unauthorized routes.
- Role assignment.
- Password reset.

## Application tests

- Eligible student applies.
- Ineligible student cannot apply.
- Duplicate application is blocked.
- Capacity is enforced.
- Coordinator approves.
- Coordinator rejects.
- Student receives the correct status.
- Concurrent applications do not exceed capacity.

## Attendance tests

- Attendance can be recorded.
- Invalid time range is rejected.
- Pending attendance is excluded from credited hours.
- Verified hours are included.
- Rejected attendance is excluded.
- Unauthorized users cannot verify attendance.

## Accomplishment tests

- Student creates a draft.
- Student submits a version.
- Coordinator approves.
- Coordinator requests revision.
- Student resubmits.
- Previous versions remain preserved.
- Rejected submissions do not become approved.
- Unauthorized users cannot review submissions.

## Report tests

- Individual report uses the exact approved submission.
- Section report includes the appropriate approved submissions.
- Report template is correct.
- File is stored safely.
- Generated report can be accessed by authorized users.
- Historical report records remain preserved.

## Security tests

- Students cannot access other students' restricted records.
- Students cannot invoke Coordinator operations.
- Section Representatives cannot access restricted Coordinator features.
- Upload validation works.
- Protected files cannot be downloaded without authorization.
- Audit logs record sensitive actions.

